sequenceDiagram
actor Operator
participant Colony as MarsColony
participant Mission
participant Rover
Operator->>Colony: setEnvironment(DUST_STORM)
alt no active mission
  Operator->>Colony: submit exploration mission
  Colony->>Mission: fail(surface restriction reason)
  Colony-->>Operator: FAILED and never active
else exploration mission in progress
  Colony->>Mission: fail(active mission restriction)
  Colony->>Rover: release rover
  Colony-->>Operator: FAILED
end
Operator->>Colony: setEnvironment(COMMUNICATION_DISRUPTION)
Colony->>Mission: fail active rescue mission if needed
